@startuml KRaft Election and Log Replication
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFDFD

autonumber

title KRaft 选举和日志复制时序图

participant "Node A\n(Candidate)" as A
participant "Node B\n(Voter)" as B  
participant "Node C\n(Voter)" as C
participant "Client" as CLIENT

== 选举阶段 ==

note over A, C
  **选举触发**: Node A 检测到选举超时
  代码: QuorumState.hasElectionTimeoutExpired()
end note

A -> A : transitionToProspective()
note right of A
  **PreVote阶段开始**
  - 不增加epoch
  - 测试是否有机会获胜
  
  **代码位置**:
  KafkaRaftClient.transitionToProspective()
end note

A -> B : VoteRequest(preVote=true, epoch=N)
A -> C : VoteRequest(preVote=true, epoch=N)

note over B
  **投票决策逻辑**:
  1. 检查候选者日志是否足够新
  2. 检查是否已投票给其他候选者
  3. PreVote不会更新投票状态
  
  **代码**: QuorumState.canGrantVote()
end note

B -> A : VoteResponse(voteGranted=true)
C -> A : VoteResponse(voteGranted=true)

A -> A : recordGrantedVote()
note right of A
  **PreVote成功**
  获得多数派PreVote
  
  **代码**:
  ProspectiveState.recordGrantedVote()
  epochElection.isVoteGranted()
end note

A -> A : transitionToCandidate()
note right of A
  **正式选举开始**
  - epoch = N + 1
  - 持久化选举状态
  
  **代码**:
  QuorumState.transitionToCandidate()
  durableTransitionTo(CandidateState)
end note

A -> B : VoteRequest(preVote=false, epoch=N+1)
A -> C : VoteRequest(preVote=false, epoch=N+1)

note over B
  **正式投票**:
  1. 验证epoch > 当前epoch
  2. 检查日志新旧程度
  3. 更新投票状态到磁盘
  
  **代码**:
  handleVoteRequest()
  transitionToVoted()
end note

B -> A : VoteResponse(voteGranted=true)
C -> A : VoteResponse(voteGranted=true)

A -> A : becomeLeader()
note right of A
  **成为Leader**:
  1. 创建BatchAccumulator
  2. 初始化Leader epoch
  3. 写入控制消息
  4. 重置网络连接
  
  **代码**:
  QuorumState.transitionToLeader()
  onBecomeLeader()
end note

A -> B : BeginQuorumEpochRequest(epoch=N+1)
A -> C : BeginQuorumEpochRequest(epoch=N+1)

B -> B : transitionToFollower()
C -> C : transitionToFollower()

B -> A : BeginQuorumEpochResponse(success)
C -> A : BeginQuorumEpochResponse(success)

== 日志复制阶段 ==

CLIENT -> A : Write Request
note right of A
  **Leader处理写请求**:
  1. 追加到BatchAccumulator
  2. 分配偏移量和epoch
  
  **代码**:
  LeaderState.appendStartOfEpochControlRecords()
  BatchAccumulator.append()
end note

A -> A : maybeAppendBatches()
note right of A
  **批量刷新**:
  1. 检查是否需要刷新
  2. 写入本地日志
  3. 更新本地状态
  
  **代码**:
  LeaderState.maybeAppendBatches()
  log.appendAsLeader()
end note

B -> A : FetchRequest(fetchOffset=X)
C -> A : FetchRequest(fetchOffset=Y)

note over A
  **处理Fetch请求**:
  1. 验证fetchOffset和epoch
  2. 读取日志数据
  3. 更新副本状态
  4. 计算新的高水位
  
  **代码**:
  handleLeaderFetchRequest()
  LeaderState.updateReplicaState()
  maybeUpdateHighWatermark()
end note

A -> A : updateReplicaState(B, fetchOffset)
A -> A : updateReplicaState(C, fetchOffset)
A -> A : maybeUpdateHighWatermark()

note right of A
  **高水位计算**:
  1. 获取所有副本的复制进度
  2. 按偏移量降序排序
  3. 取中位数作为新高水位
  
  **代码**:
  LeaderState.followersByDescendingFetchOffset()
  计算多数派已复制的偏移量
end note

A -> B : FetchResponse(records, highWatermark=Z)
A -> C : FetchResponse(records, highWatermark=Z)

B -> B : appendAsFollower(records)
C -> C : appendAsFollower(records)

note over B, C
  **Follower处理**:
  1. 追加日志到本地
  2. 更新高水位
  3. 通知状态机提交
  
  **代码**:
  log.appendAsFollower()
  updateFollowerHighWatermark()
  maybeFireHandleCommit()
end note

B -> B : maybeFireHandleCommit()
C -> C : maybeFireHandleCommit()

A -> CLIENT : Write Response(success)

== 快照处理 ==

note over A
  **快照触发条件**:
  - 日志大小超过阈值
  - 定期快照策略
  
  **代码**:
  log.maybeClean()
end note

A -> A : createSnapshot()
note right of A
  **创建快照**:
  1. 创建RecordsSnapshotWriter
  2. 写入状态机数据
  3. 冻结快照
  
  **代码**:
  RecordsSnapshotWriter.append()
  RecordsSnapshotWriter.freeze()
end note

B -> A : FetchSnapshotRequest(snapshotId)

A -> B : FetchSnapshotResponse(snapshotData)

B -> B : downloadSnapshot()
note right of B
  **下载快照**:
  1. 分块下载快照数据
  2. 验证快照完整性
  3. 截断日志到快照点
  4. 重新加载状态机
  
  **代码**:
  handleFetchSnapshotResponse()
  log.truncateToLatestSnapshot()
end note

== 故障处理 ==

note over A, C
  **Leader失效场景**
end note

A -x B : 网络分区
A -x C : 网络分区

B -> B : fetchTimeoutExpired()
C -> C : fetchTimeoutExpired()

note over B, C
  **检测Leader失效**:
  - Fetch请求超时
  - 没有收到心跳
  
  **代码**:
  FollowerState.hasFetchTimeoutExpired()
end note

B -> B : transitionToProspective()
C -> C : transitionToProspective()

B -> C : VoteRequest(preVote=true, epoch=N+1)
C -> B : VoteRequest(preVote=true, epoch=N+1)

note over B, C
  **新一轮选举开始**
  重复选举流程...
end note

note over A, C
  **关键代码路径总结**:
  
  **选举相关**:
  - QuorumState.transitionToProspective/Candidate/Leader()
  - KafkaRaftClient.handleVoteRequest/Response()
  - EpochElection.recordVote()
  
  **日志复制**:
  - KafkaRaftClient.handleFetchRequest/Response()
  - LeaderState.updateReplicaState()
  - LeaderState.maybeUpdateHighWatermark()
  
  **状态持久化**:
  - QuorumState.durableTransitionTo()
  - FileQuorumStateStore.writeElectionState()
  
  **快照机制**:
  - RecordsSnapshotWriter.append/freeze()
  - KafkaRaftClient.handleFetchSnapshotRequest()
end note

@enduml
